Package: keyscreen
Version: 1.0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-evdev, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: Liberty Global Education <info@libertyglobaleducation.com>
Description: Show pressed keys on screen (works on Wayland)
 Small overlay that displays your keystrokes in a corner of the screen,
 useful for screen recording and tutorials. Open it from the app menu;
 open it again to stop it.
